{"id":"0046b6ed4e0627591fbbbdf85895ac7394cea200","url":"https://www.businessinsider.com/openai-ai-data-centers-rebrand-compute-campuses-midterms-2026-11","title":"OpenAI wants everyone to call AI data centers 'compute campuses'","site_name":"TechURLs","source":"Business Insider","byline":"Truman Dickerson","excerpt":"An OpenAI spokesperson said the term better represents the \"role\" of AI infrastructure.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><section data-content-container=\"\" role=\"main\">\n\n    \n      \n    \n      <div data-load-strategy=\"disable-lazy\" data-component-type=\"post-top\" data-e2e-name=\"post-top\">\n    \n          \n            \n            \n            \n            \n              <div data-e2e-name=\"post-byline\" data-component-type=\"post-byline\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-byline\">\n                        <p><span>By</span>\n                                \n                                \n                                \n                                  <span data-e2e-name=\"Truman Dickerson\">\n                                \n                                    <span>\n                                      <a data-e2e-name=\"byline-author-name\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/author/truman-dickerson\">Truman Dickerson</a>        \n                                  <span data-disable-for-sooth-user=\"\" data-component-type=\"follow-button\" data-load-strategy=\"lazy\" role=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip-position=\"middle\" data-tooltip-active=\"false\" data-state=\"\" data-topic-type=\"author\" data-topic-slug=\"truman-dickerson\" data-topic-link=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/author/truman-dickerson\" data-topic-label=\"Truman Dickerson\" data-topic-location=\"byline\" data-topic-shortened-label=\"Truman\" data-topic-image=\"{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;6a7252cb3f00ff875d13cb15&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Truman Dickerson's picture&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:1206,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;Truman Dickerson&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1206},&quot;links&quot;:{&quot;self&quot;:&quot;https://i.insider.com/6a7252cb3f00ff875d13cb15&quot;}}\">\n                                    \n                                  \n                                    <div>\n                                      <p>\n                                          You're currently following this author!\n                                   Click to unsubscribe from email alerts.\n                                      </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    \n                                  </span>\n                                    </span>\n                                  </span>  </p>\n                      </div>\n        </div>\n\n  <section>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <section id=\"post-body\" data-component-type=\"post-body\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-lock-content=\"\">\n            \n            \n            \n              <div data-e2e-name=\"post-hero\" data-component-type=\"post-hero\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\">\n                    <figure data-type=\"img\" data-e2e-name=\"image-figure-image\" data-media-container=\"image\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\">\n                        <div>\n                          <meta itemprop=\"contentUrl\" content=\"https://i.insider.com/6ae7b834d8cc18cf7950ff5e?width=1200\">\n                          <p><img src=\"https://i.insider.com/6ae7b834d8cc18cf7950ff5e?width=700\" srcset=\"https://i.insider.com/6ae7b834d8cc18cf7950ff5e?width=400&format=jpeg&auto=webp 400w, https://i.insider.com/6ae7b834d8cc18cf7950ff5e?width=500&format=jpeg&auto=webp 500w, https://i.insider.com/6ae7b834d8cc18cf7950ff5e?width=700&format=jpeg&auto=webp 700w, https://i.insider.com/6ae7b834d8cc18cf7950ff5e?width=1000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1000w, https://i.insider.com/6ae7b834d8cc18cf7950ff5e?width=1300&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1300w, https://i.insider.com/6ae7b834d8cc18cf7950ff5e?width=2000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 2000w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 900px\" alt=\"OpenAI's Sarah Friar and Sam Altman stand at a construction site.\" decoding=\"sync\">\n                        </p></div>\n                    \n                          <span>\n                              <span>\n                                \n                                <label for=\"caption-drawer-btn\">\n                                          </label>\n                        \n                            <figcaption data-e2e-name=\"image-caption\">\n                              <span>OpenAI has a new, more chic name for data centers.</span>\n                              <span>\n                                <span data-e2e-name=\"image-source\" itemprop=\"creditText\">Bloomberg/Getty Images</span>      </span>\n                            </figcaption>\n                          </span>\n                        </span>\n                        \n                    </figure>\n              </div>\n    \n    \n    \n          \n    \n            \n    \n    \n          \n    \n            \n            \n            \n    \n          \n    \n      <section data-load-strategy=\"lazy\" data-component-type=\"image-modal\" data-track-content=\"\" data-post-type=\"story\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-body-content\">\n                \n                    <p>OpenAI doesn't want to call them \"<a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/category/data-centers\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">data centers</a>\" anymore.</p><p>Instead, the ChatGPT maker plans to propose a new, more chic name for the behemoth factories that power your chatbot queries.</p><p>That new name is \"compute campuses,\" an OpenAI spokesperson confirmed to Business Insider on Sunday.</p><p>\"Compute campuses better describes the scale and role of the infrastructure we're building for AI,\" the spokesperson said. \"These are long-term investments in computing, energy infrastructure and skilled work.\"</p><p>Though much has been said about the less-than-stellar reputations of AI data centers (a recent Pew Research poll found that 54% of Americans say AI data centers are bad for the environment), efforts to ameliorate that view have mostly failed. Data centers are now a <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/ai-data-centers-backlash-debate-poll-midterm-election-2026-10\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">major issue for voters</a> in the midterms.</p><p>While major <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/ai-data-center-near-me-location-tracker-2026-6\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">data center builders</a> like Meta, Amazon, and Microsoft have pledged millions of dollars to the communities and schools surrounding their centers, OpenAI is betting that a complete rebrand will also help turn around public opinion.</p><p>\"We want the communities hosting that infrastructure to help shape it and share in the opportunities it creates,\" the OpenAI spokesperson said.</p><p>Time will tell, however, if the \"compute campus\" lingo catches on.</p><p>Axios<strong><s> </s></strong>earlier reported that OpenAI was also preparing for a blue wave in Tuesday's midterm elections, which could result in a more regulatory-minded government.</p>\n                \n                \n                </section>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      </section>\n\n    \n    <!-- Included desktop \"post-aside\" -->    \n\n    \n      \n      <section data-component-type=\"post-bottom\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-bottom\">\n        <section>\n    \n    \n            \n            \n    \n            \n            \n            <section data-component-type=\"read-next\" data-e2e-name=\"read-next\" data-display-size=\"4\" data-post-id=\"6ae787437a0ec5bc41573fe2\" data-root-margin=\"250px 0px\" data-track-view=\"{&quot;subscription_experience&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;}\">\n              <h2>Read next</h2>\n            \n              <div data-track-click-shared=\"{&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;,&quot;click_text&quot;:&quot;Read next&quot;}\" data-recommendations-content=\"\" data-e2e-name=\"read-next-list\" data-recommendations-list=\"\">\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    <article data-component-type=\"tout\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-post-id=\"post\">\n                     \n                          \n                            <span>    <p><img data-src=\"/public/assets/logos/placeholder.png\" data-old-src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 1 1'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" src=\"/public/assets/logos/placeholder.png\" alt=\"\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            </p>  </span>\n                          \n                    \n                    \n                          <h3>\n                            <span>Business Insider tells the innovat