ider on Sunday.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>\"Compute campuses better describes the scale and role of the infrastructure we're building for AI,\" the spokesperson said. \"These are long-term investments in computing, energy infrastructure and skilled work.\"</p>","sentences":[{"en":"\"Compute campuses better describes the scale and role of the infrastructure we're building for AI,\" the spokesperson said.","zh":null},{"en":"\"These are long-term investments in computing, energy infrastructure and skilled work.\"","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Though much has been said about the less-than-stellar reputations of AI data centers (a recent Pew Research poll found that 54% of Americans say AI data centers are bad for the environment), efforts to ameliorate that view have mostly failed. Data centers are now a <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/ai-data-centers-backlash-debate-poll-midterm-election-2026-10\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">major issue for voters</a> in the midterms.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Though much has been said about the less-than-stellar reputations of AI data centers (a recent Pew Research poll found that 54% of Americans say AI data centers are bad for the environment), efforts to ameliorate that view have mostly failed.","zh":null},{"en":"Data centers are now a major issue for voters in the midterms.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>While major <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/ai-data-center-near-me-location-tracker-2026-6\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">data center builders</a> like Meta, Amazon, and Microsoft have pledged millions of dollars to the communities and schools surrounding their centers, OpenAI is betting that a complete rebrand will also help turn around public opinion.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"While major data center builders like Meta, Amazon, and Microsoft have pledged millions of dollars to the communities and schools surrounding their centers, OpenAI is betting that a complete rebrand will also help turn around public opinion.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>\"We want the communities hosting that infrastructure to help shape it and share in the opportunities it creates,\" the OpenAI spokesperson said.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"\"We want the communities hosting that infrastructure to help shape it and share in the opportunities it creates,\" the OpenAI spokesperson said.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Time will tell, however, if the \"compute campus\" lingo catches on.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Time will tell, however, if the \"compute campus\" lingo catches on.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Axios<strong><s> </s></strong>earlier reported that OpenAI was also preparing for a blue wave in Tuesday's midterm elections, which could result in a more regulatory-minded government.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Axios earlier reported that OpenAI was also preparing for a blue wave in Tuesday's midterm elections, which could result in a more regulatory-minded government.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2>Read next</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Read next","zh":"阅读下一篇"}]},{"html_en":"<h3>\n                            <span>Business Insider tells the innovative stories you want to know</span>\n                          </h3>","sentences":[{"en":"Business Insider tells the innovative stories you want to know","zh":"商业内幕讲述您想知道的创新故事"}]},{"html_en":"<h3>\n                            <span>Business Insider tells the innovative stories you want to know</span>\n                          </h3>","sentences":[{"en":"Business Insider tells the innovative stories you want to know","zh":"商业内幕讲述您想知道的创新故事"}]},