:"Click to unsubscribe from email alerts.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n                  You're currently following this author!\n           Click to unsubscribe from email alerts.\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"You're currently following this author!","zh":"您目前正在关注该作者！"},{"en":"Click to unsubscribe from email alerts.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>Truman Dickerson is the Weekend News Fellow at Business Insider, based in New York City. He covers trending tech and business news. He previously reported for The Boston Globe's Express Desk. He graduated from Boston University, where he served as editor in chief of The Daily Free Press, BU's student-run newspaper.Contact him at Tdickerson@insider.com</span>\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Truman Dickerson is the Weekend News Fellow at Business Insider, based in New York City.","zh":"杜鲁门·迪克森 (Truman Dickerson) 是《商业内幕》的周末新闻研究员，驻纽约市。"},{"en":"He covers trending tech and business news.","zh":"他报道热门科技和商业新闻。"},{"en":"He previously reported for The Boston Globe's Express Desk.","zh":"他此前曾为《波士顿环球报》的 Express Desk 进行报道。"},{"en":"He graduated from Boston University, where he served as editor in chief of The Daily Free Press, BU's student-run newspaper.Contact him at Tdickerson@insider.com","zh":"他毕业于波士顿大学，曾担任波士顿大学学生报纸《自由日报》的主编。请通过 Tdickerson@insider.com 与他联系"}]},{"html_en":"<li>\n                  <a data-track-click=\"\" href=\"/category/openai\" title=\"OpenAI\">OpenAI</a>\n                </li>","sentences":[{"en":"OpenAI","zh":"开放人工智能"}]},{"html_en":"<li>\n                  <a data-track-click=\"\" href=\"/category/data-centers\" title=\"Data Centers\">Data Centers</a>\n                </li>","sentences":[{"en":"Data Centers","zh":"数据中心"}]},{"html_en":"<li>\n                  <a data-track-click=\"\" href=\"/category/sam-altman\" title=\"Sam Altman\">Sam Altman</a>\n                </li>","sentences":[{"en":"Sam Altman","zh":"萨姆·奥特曼"}]},{"html_en":"<li>\n                  <span data-track-click=\"{&quot;click_text&quot;:&quot;More&quot;,&quot;click_path&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">More </span>\n                </li>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<li>\n                    <a data-track-click=\"\" href=\"/category/chat-gpt\" title=\"ChatGPT\">ChatGPT</a>\n                  </li>","sentences":[{"en":"ChatGPT","zh":"聊天GPT"}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><section data-content-container=\"\" role=\"main\">\n\n    \n      \n    \n      <div data-load-strategy=\"disable-lazy\" data-component-type=\"post-top\" data-e2e-name=\"post-top\">\n    \n          \n            \n            \n            \n            \n              <div data-e2e-name=\"post-byline\" data-component-type=\"post-byline\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-byline\">\n                        <p>By Truman Dickerson You're currently following this author! Click to unsubscribe from email alerts.</p>\n                      </div>\n        </div>\n\n  <section>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <section id=\"post-body\" data-component-type=\"post-body\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-lock-content=\"\">\n            \n            \n            \n              <div data-e2e-name=\"post-hero\" data-component-type=\"post-hero\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\">\n                    <figure data-type=\"img\" data-e2e-name=\"image-figure-image\" data-media-container=\"image\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\">\n                        <div>\n                          <meta itemprop=\"contentUrl\" content=\"https://i.insider.com/6ae7b834d8cc18cf7950ff5e?width=1200\">\n                          <p><img src=\"https://i.insider.com/6ae7b834d8cc18cf7950ff5e?width=700\" srcset=\"https://i.insider.com/6ae7b834d8cc18cf7950ff5e?width=400&format=jpeg&auto=webp 400w, https://i.insider.com/6ae7b834d8cc18cf7950ff5e?width=500&format=jpeg&auto=webp 500w, https://i.insider.com/6ae7b834d8cc18cf7950ff5e?width=700&format=jpeg&auto=webp 700w, https://i.insider.com/6ae7b834d8cc18cf7950ff5e?width=1000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1000w, https://i.insider.com/6ae7b834d8cc18cf7950ff5e?width=1300&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1300w, https://i.insider.com/6ae7b834d8cc18cf7950ff5e?width=2000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 2000w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 900px\" alt=\"OpenAI's Sarah Friar and Sam Altman stand at a construction site.\" decoding=\"sync\">\n                        </p></div>\n                    \n                          <span>\n                              <span>\n                                \n                                <label for=\"caption-drawer-btn\">\n                                          </label>\n                        \n                            <figcaption data-e2e-name=\"image-caption\">OpenAI has a new, more chic name for data centers. 彭博社/盖蒂图片社</figcaption>\n                          </span>\n                        </span>\n                        \n                    </figure>\n              </div>\n    \n    \n    \n          \n    \n            \n    \n    \n          \n    \n            \n            \n            \n    \n          \n    \n      <section data-load-strategy=\"lazy\" data-component-type=\"image-modal\" data-track-content=\"\" data-post-type=\"story\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-body-content\">\n                \n                    <p>OpenAI doesn't want to call them \"data centers\" anymore.</p><p>Instead, the ChatGPT maker plans to propose a new, more chic name for the behemoth factories that power your chatbot queries.</p><p>That new name is \"compute campuses,\" an OpenAI spokesperson confirmed to Business Insider on Sunday.</p><p>\"Compute campuses better describes the scale and role of the infrastructure we're building for AI,\" the spokesperson said. \"These are long-term investments in computing, energy infrastructure and skilled work.\"</p><p>Though much has been said about the less-than-stellar reputations of AI data centers (a recent Pew Research poll found that 54% of Americans say AI data centers are bad for the environment), efforts to ameliorate that view have mostly failed. Data centers are now a major issue for voters in the midterms.</p><p>While major data center builders like Meta, Amazon, and Microsoft have pledged millions of dollars to the communities and schools surrounding their centers, OpenAI is betting that a complete rebrand will also help turn around public opinion.</p><p>\"We want the communities hosting that infrastructure to help shape it and share in the opportunities it creates,\" the OpenAI spokesperson said.</p><p>Time will tell, however, if the \"compute campus\" lingo catches on.</p><p>Axios earlier reported that OpenAI was also preparing for a blue wave in Tuesday's midterm elections, which could result in a more regulatory-minded government.</p>\n                \n                \n                </section>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      </section>\n\n    \n    <!-- Included desktop \"post-aside\" -->    \n\n    \n      \n      <section data-component-type=\"post-bottom\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-bottom\">\n        <section>\n    \n    \n            \n            \n    \n            \n            \n            <section data-component-type=\"read-next\" data-e2e-name=\"read-next\" data-display-size=\"4\" data-post-id=\"6ae787437a0ec5bc41573fe2\" data-root-margin=\"250px 0px\" data-track-view=\"{&quot;subscription_experience&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;}\">\n              <h2>阅读下一篇</h2>\n            \n              <div data-track-click-shared=\"{&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;,&quot;click_text&quot;:&quot;Read next&quot;}\" data-recommendations-content=\"\" data-e2e-name=\"read-next-list\" da